sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as System (config change)
    participant Act as Activity (Ch 44)
    participant Theme as MaterialTheme
    participant VM as ViewModel

    OS->>Act: dark mode / density / locale change (config change, Ch 44)
    Act->>Act: recreate activity
    Act->>VM: state survives (ViewModel/rememberSaveable, Ch 44)
    Act->>Theme: re-resolve theme from NEW config (dark scheme / new density / locale)
    Theme-->>Act: components recompose with new tokens - consistent, state intact
